1 polymer     man 'Tyrosine-protein kinase Fgr' 20302.867 1   2.7.10.2 'T252P, A256R' ? 
;Human Fgr SH3, SH2 and linker domains; the wild-type linker residues T252 and A256 were mutated to P252 and R256, respectively. N-terminal serine residue originates from Sumo tag Ulp1 cleavage. Residue C131 was covalently modified with beta mercaptoethanol reducing agent during purification.
